      "content": "finding my own side sounds nice, but there's nobody there. it's just a void. honestly, sometimes i think maybe the only way to actually stop the noise and just find some peace is to just... stop. like, if the struggle is constant, maybe the only real way to win is to just leave the game entirely. it feels like the only logical option left.",
